    schema:image <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/trustgraph-ai/demo-standard/refs/heads/master/datasets/retail-ux/images/first-aid-kit.jpg> ;
    rdfs:comment "Comprehensive 100-piece first aid kit designed for outdoor activities. Includes adhesive bandages, gauze, antiseptic wipes, pain relief medication, blister treatment, tweezers, scissors, and an emergency whistle. Packaged in a waterproof bag weighing just 0.75 lbs. Covers the most common injuries and ailments encountered during camping, hiking, and outdoor recreation." ;
